    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="33">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 33</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be ungetreowum mannum. Gyf hwylc man se ðe eallum folce ungetrywe sy, fare ðæs cynges geréfa to ⁊ gebringe hine under borge, þæt híne man to rihte lǽde ðam ðe him on specan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning untrustworthy men. If there is anyone who is regarded with suspicion by the general public, the king's reeve shall go and place him under surety so that he may be brought to do justice to those who have made charges against him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwylc man si, þe eallum folce ungetrywe, fare þæs cingces gerefa to, ⁊ gebringan hine under borge, þæt hine man to rihte læde þam ðe him on spræcan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
